  (text "Firefly ISP jig rev 0.1: socket + power for an AVRISP mkII"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2.5 2.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6aa01649-4085-5b89-969a-0858a7e85eb7"))
  (text "The mkII does not power the target. JP1 picks USB 5 V (via F1) or an external 1.8-5.5 V supply on J2."
    (at 25.4 33.02 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bea62745-4ddf-571f-aaad-b95797b1c64c"))
  (text "D1 shows target power. Plug the mkII ribbon into J3 with pin 1 (red stripe) at the marked corner."
    (at 25.4 38.1 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d596c4f4-0544-58b0-a3b2-344a251e35b4"))
  (text "Target: any 8-pin AVR with the ATtiny13A/25/45/85 pinout. J4 brings all 8 pins out for a scope or breadboard."
    (at 25.4 93.98 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fbcb847b-fcc2-5e5c-9f88-7289d534cc65"))
  (text "D2 + R3 copy the firefly LED (PB0 -> 150R -> LED -> PB1). Pull JP2 while programming: the LED loads MOSI/MISO."
    (at 25.4 99.06 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "36529faa-813c-5737-ad71-3121051b13ea"))
